        "cases": ["与 optimizer.character.switch 同一用例：切换后存档里的 optimizerCharacterId 与离开角色的表单都与网页一致"],
        "tests": ["mcp/scripts/smoke-form.mjs", "mcp/scripts/smoke-state.mjs"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "characters.rank.move",
      "title": "调整角色优先级",
      "surface": { "page": "CHARACTERS", "entry": "拖拽角色行；或角色菜单「移到顶部」" },
      "kind": "write",
      "action": "insertCharacter(id, index) 把角色移到目标位置并防抖保存。拖拽时目标位置取落点行在完整列表里的下标；「移到顶部」等价于 index=0。角色顺序即优先级，决定优化器的优先级过滤能动用谁身上的遗器。",
      "upstream": [
        { "file": "src/lib/tabs/tabCharacters/CharacterGrid.tsx", "symbol": "handleDragEnd" },
        { "file": "src/lib/tabs/tabCharacters/characterTabController.ts", "symbol": "moveFocusCharacterToTop" },
        { "file": "src/lib/stores/character/characterStore.ts", "symbol": "insertCharacter" }
      ],
      "params": [
        { "name": "characterId", "type": "CharacterId" },
        { "name": "index", "type": "number", "notes": "0 为最高优先级" }
      ],
      "conditions": "「移到顶部」需要先选中角色，否则提示未选择角色。指针拖动 3px 后才开始拖拽，触屏需长按 200ms。",
      "runtime": "node",
      "state": { "owner": "useCharacterStore.characters（数组顺序）", "lifecycle": "persisted", "saveKey": "characters" },
      "sideEffects": ["SaveState.delayedSave()"],
      "mcp": { "status": "implemented", "tools": ["set_character_rank"] },
      "scope": "baseline",
      "upstreamChange": "none",
      "acceptance": {
        "cases": ["把同一角色移到同一位置后，两边导出存档的 characters 顺序一致；index=0 与「移到顶部」等价"],
        "tests": ["mcp/scripts/smoke-equip.mjs"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "characters.rank.sortByEffectiveSubstats",
      "title": "按有效副词条自动排序",
      "surface": { "page": "CHARACTERS", "entry": "角色菜单 → 优先级 →「按有效副词条排序」" },
      "kind": "write",
      "action": "对每个角色把身上各件遗器的潜力当前值（scoreRelicPotential().currentPct）相加，按总和从高到低重排全部角色并防抖保存。",
